    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Corry Estates are delighted to bring to the market No. 58 St Donagh`s Road, a bright and spacious three bedroom property with the added benefit of a fantastic open plan extension that incorporates a kitchen / living / dining area. The property comprises of entrance hall with laminate floor and under stairs storage, modern bathroom suite complete with jacuzzi bath, open plan kitchen / living  / dining area with island unit and a utility room completes the ground floor accommodation. First floor comprises of 3 generous sized bedrooms. Externally there is private gardens to front and rear. Further features include: PVC double glazed windows and gas fired radiator central heating. Perfectly located on a quiet mature cul-de-sac the property is within walking distance of a host of local shops, schools, Dart station, and commuter bus links into the city centre. Donaghmede Shopping Centre provides for an abundance of shops and restaurants all within a stones throw of the house. Viewing comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Reception Hall\r\n1.67m (5'6\") x 2.77m (9'1\") Laminate flooring, understair storage\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n1.58m (5'2\") x 2.64m (8'8\") Modern suite, comprising of Jacuzzi Bath, W.C, W.H.B, Heated towel rail. Fully tilled. Recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nLounge\r\n4.41m (14'6\") x 3.67m (12'0\") TV Point, Radiator Cover. Laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\n Plumbed for washing machine. Laminate flooring. \r\n(+ Boiler Area 1.79m x 1.91m)\r\n\r\nExtended Kitchen/Dining Area\r\n4.57m (15'0\") x 4.43m (14'6\") Range of high gloss fitted press units. Tiled behind worktops. Intergrated fridge-freezer. Island unit. 2x Velux windows. Recessed lighting. \r\nDouble doors to rear garden.\r\n\r\nLanding\r\n0.88m (2'11\") x 2.1m (6'11\") Laminate flooring. Access to attic.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n2.66m (8'9\") x 4.74m (15'7\") Fitted wardrobes. Laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.45m (11'4\") x 3.49m (11'5\") Fitted wardrobes. Laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n2.51m (8'3\") x 2.63m (8'8\") Fitted wardrobes. Laminate flooring.\r\n\r\n\r\nOutside: Garden to front with lawn and on-street parking. Walled rear garden laid in lawn with patio area"
      },
